{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042480/extras/c9ef671cffd87089a0ecd019e784aa6f.avif?t=1761826653\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marina and Marcello Forlani are the sibling design team behind the fashion label <i>Forlani</i>. But after their 2025 Milan collection is torn apart by critics, they\u2019re in desperate need of a break. Luckily, an old friend offers the perfect escape: a stay at the luxurious Bibi Resort on the dreamy island of Fuente Grande.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun, style, and plenty of romance await. Between poolside cocktails, glittering soir\u00e9es, and quiet walks along the beach, Marina and Marcello will meet an array of captivating women; each with her own charm, secrets, and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Times at the Bibi Resort and Hotel</strong> is a romantic comedy Visual Novel and Dating Sim. Play as Marina (a lesbian woman) or Marcello (a straight man) as you explore paradise and chase the possibility of love. Will you find your perfect match in the island breeze?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple romance routes and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven storytelling with plenty of replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glamorous luxury resort setting full of surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful anime art that brings every moment to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A groovy smooth jazz soundtrack to set the mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHARACTERS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st